        {
          "text": "riti Bgira ab’ inzu ya Isirayeli, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ngo Ngira mpumanye ahantu hanje hēra, aho mwishimira yukw ari ho bubasha bganyu, mukahamizakw amaso, imitima yanyu ikahagirira igishika; kand’ abahungu banyu n’abakobga banyu mwasizeyo bazoririkwa n’ inkota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
